    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<h3>Balancing tools should be standard practice. Those who balance have a better grip on risks - at any speed.</h3>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c705",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<p><strong>Many precision grinders and machinists associate balancing exclusively with very high speeds. In reality, however, every rotating tool has the potential to become unbalanced. The negative consequences can be immediate - or only trigger high costs and machine downtime after some time.</strong></p> <p>Balancing leads to greater efficiency because it reduces cost-driving tool wear. It prevents expensive machine downtime and reduces time-consuming quality complaints. <br/> The »toolBalancer series« from ZOLLER features a globally unique balancing technology. The newly developed devices offer many innovations that take precision, safety, ergonomics and operation to an unprecedented level of quality.</p> <p>Keep production risks to a minimum. With ZOLLER - the most advanced balancing technology on the market.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ru/products/balancing-technology/toolbalancer\">Show products</a></p>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c706",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ]
   ],
   "ftype": "container-2cols",
   "id": "c704",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {
    "before": "extra-small",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Precise measurement with high sensor signal </h2>",
   "body": "<p>A special feature of every »toolBalancer« is the measuring method. ZOLLER uses a special balancing adapter with center offset, two-point system and pressure piece.</p> <p>This metrological approach increases the sensor signal and therefore the quality of the measurement. You receive outstandingly accurate balancing results. </p>",
   "images": [],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "text",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c707",
   "bg": "black",
   "space": {
    "before": "extra-large",
    "after": "extra-large"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2 class=\"headline-decor\"> Bring back the calm </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">Improve running smoothness to the maximum with balanced tools. Reduce centrifugal forces in the drives of your CNC machines, avoid unnecessary maintenance and protect yourself against spindle damage.</p> <p class=\"large-text\">With balancing results of &lt; 0.4 gmm, ZOLLER balancing technology also ensures the productivity of your machines. »toolBalancer« identifies even minor imbalances that can put a heavy load on spindles or bearings and shorten the service life of components. </p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/1/8/csm_balancing_01_4186f932b3.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1920,
     "h": 1967
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c708",
   "bg": "white",
   "space": {
    "before": "small",
    "after": "small"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2 class=\"headline-decor\"> More stability during downtime </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">Regular balancing with precision technology from ZOLLER keeps the service life of tools stable at a high level. You benefit in the long term from greater cost-effectiveness and rapid amortization of your investment.</p> <p class=\"large-text\">If a rotating tool runs only slightly out of round, additional forces act on the cutting edge. The tool life decreases, tool costs increase and the intervals between tool changes are shortened.</p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/7/7/csm_balancing_02_aaf3ff5460.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1220,
     "h": 1250
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c709",
   "bg": "white",
   "space": {
    "before": "none",
    "after": "none"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2 class=\"headline-decor\"> Top quality surfaces </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">Eliminate imbalances on tools and grinding wheels as a quality-reducing risk. ZOLLER balancing technology simplifies the way to surfaces that satisfy even the most demanding industries.</p> <p class=\"large-text\">If tools run out of round, this can lead to quality deficits on surfaces. In most cases, cutting parameters or the tool are suspected as the cause. However, by the time an imbalance is taken into consideration, a lot of machine uptime, material and tool life has been wasted. </p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/d/8/csm_balancing_03_8d69d2b1ea.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1920,
     "h": 1967
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
